  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Citizenship as Agency: Building an analytical framework to explore the dynamic between economic, political, and environemental citizenship.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Governors of St. Francis Xavier University: Coady International Institute in Canada, will coordinate a collaborative research project to explore key issues in citizen-led development. The IAF will collaborate directly in the design of the evolving partnership, and will participate directly in the identification and selection of Latin American participants. The project will directly engage 50 people from Asia, Africa, and the Americas in action research, and indirectly benefit thousands of practitioners and researchers.</narrative>
  </description>
